kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-expandable-output"
purpose: "通用 ExpandableOutput：max-height 视口、earlier/more 提示、流式贴尾（供工具/bash 详情）。"
valid_scope[1]: "packages/xylitol-tui/"
requirements[7]{req_id,title,statement}:
  meta0,"capability-shell","本 capability 由变更 c466-add-package-tui-expandable-output 引入；归档合并后以 delta 增补的 requirements 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  peo1,"expandable-api",包 MUST 提供 ExpandableOutput 与 render_expandable_output；选项 MUST 含 max_preview_lines、TruncateFrom（Tail 或 Head）、expand_hint；MUST NOT 依赖主 crate xylitol。
  peo2,"collapsed-tail-hint",当 collapsed 且跳过行数大于 0 时 Tail 模式 MUST 在可见尾部之上渲染 dim 提示（含 earlier lines 与 expand_hint）；Head 模式 MUST 在尾部提示 more lines。
  peo3,"streaming-stick-tail",流式追加文本时 collapsed Tail 视口 MUST 继续显示最新视觉行；expanded MUST 显示全文且无 earlier 提示。
  peo0,"capability-shell","本增量由变更 c550-update-package-tui-expandable-edges 引入；归档合并后以本 delta 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  peo4,"head-more-hint","当 TruncateFrom::Head 且 collapsed 并跳过行数大于 0 时，MUST 在可见首部之下渲染 dim 的 more lines 提示（含 expand_hint）；MUST NOT 把该提示放在首部之上冒充 Tail。"
  peo5,"zero-width-safe",ExpandableOutput 在 width 为 0 或 1、或文本为空时 MUST 安全返回（空或有界行）；MUST NOT panic。
scenarios[8]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  meta0,"shell-present","","列出 llmanspec/specs/package-tui-expandable-output",spec.toon 存在且 purpose 为中文
  peo1,"api-export","",从 xylitol_tui 引用,ExpandableOutput 与 render_expandable_output 可导出
  peo2,"hint-above-tail",文本超过 max_preview_lines,collapsed Tail render,首行含 earlier lines 与 expand_hint 且末行是原文尾
  peo3,"stream-then-expand",连续 append 多行,collapsed 再 set_expanded,collapsed 贴尾且 expanded 无 earlier 提示
  peo0,"shell-present","","列出 capability package-tui-expandable-output",delta 含 peo4–peo5
  peo4,"head-hint",文本超过 max_preview_lines 且 Head,collapsed render,末行附近含 more lines 与 expand_hint 且首行是原文头
  peo5,"empty-text","",空串 render,不 panic 且行数有界
  peo5,"width-one",多行文本,width=1 collapsed render,不 panic
